  "description": "<p>Some of the predicates passed to the JMS producer (in the org.fcrepo.jms.properties header) use the JCR namespace. </p>\n\n<p>For example: <a href=\"http://www.jcp.org/jcr/1.0lastModified,http://www.jcp.org/jcr/1.0createdBy\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.jcp.org/jcr/1.0lastModified,http://www.jcp.org/jcr/1.0createdBy</a></p>\n\n<p>These should be replaced the the <a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#</a> namespace.</p>",
